    description: "Phase 4a of ADR-0027. Add x-deprecated annotation to docs/schema.json for every Symbol.kind value classified as endpoint_shape in the canonical registry. Values stay valid in the enum during the deprecation window. SCHEMA_VERSION minor bump (0.4.x → 0.5.0) marks the announcement.\n\nPer-value migration guidance lives in the registry's SymbolKindSpec.description (already populated in Phase 1). Update scripts/generate-schema to read spec.description and emit it alongside x-deprecated when the value's axis is endpoint_shape.\n\nMirrors ADR-0023's Phase 4a additive shape.\n\nReference: docs/adr/0027-symbol-kind-language-construct-only.md §\"Phase 4 — schema bump and deprecation removal\"."  # c133
